{"id":"00712","root":"uni00712_1","name":{"ja":"ブリジット","en":"Brigitte"},"title":{"ja":"【おきつねバニー】","en":"【Fox Bunny】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【おきつねバニー】 ブリジット","en":"【Fox Bunny】 Brigitte"},"aliases":["Bridget"],"element":"Devilish","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2023-07-31","limited":true,"characterId":48,"profile":{"ja":"魔界の氷雪地帯で狩りをして暮らす狐の獣人の一族で、人間界では妖狐と呼ばれる種族の娘。見た目は人間に近いが、頭には尖った耳、お尻にはふわふわの尻尾がはえている。警戒心は強いが、人や魔族には慣れやすく、一度慣れると犬猫のように懐いてしまう。ブリジットは族長の娘で、無邪気で幼い性格からひょいひょい色々なところに行ってはいろんな経験を積み、狩りをして土産を持って帰ってくる。最近では魔界での狩りに飽きたようで、人間界に行っては色々と学んでいる。戦闘の時は巨大な獣に変化し相手をかみ殺すが、人型の時は人間に毛がはえた程度の強さである。そんな彼女が敵地潜入の為にバニースーツを身に着けた。一生懸命な接客と愛らしい姿に魅せられる者は多い。","en":"She is a member of a fox beast-person tribe that lives hunting in the icy snowfields of the Demon Realm, and in the Human Realm she's called a yōko. She looks almost human but has pointed ears on her head and a fluffy tail on her rear. She's very wary, but she quickly gets used to people and demons, and once she does she becomes as affectionate as a dog or cat. Brigitte is the chieftain's daughter; her innocent, childlike nature makes her dart about, gaining all sorts of experience and bringing back trophies from her hunts. Lately she's grown bored of hunting in the Demon Realm and has been traveling to the Human Realm to learn new things. In battle she can transform into a gigantic beast to bite foes to death, while in human form she has strength roughly equivalent to a normal human covered in fur. She's wearing a bunny suit for infiltration. Her earnest hospitality and adorable appearance captivate many."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"伊ヶ崎綾香","forms":[{"id":"uni00712_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[872,1744],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[121,242],"def":[122,244],"spd":[47,47],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","1950009"]},{"id":"uni00712_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1344,2688],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[192,384],"def":[194,388],"spd":[47,47],